WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.540
After Dumpling Brothers and I tied

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.720
at the Guangzhou Dumpling Competition,

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:40.200
Young Spring Restaurant

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.010
won the finals.

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.320
Meanwhile,
I received a letter of recommendation

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:46.730
from Provincial Military Commander Li
to take the Super Chef Test.

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:48.990
You've progressed much quicker

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:51.080
than I expected.

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.050
I guess the time has finally come.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.150
What time?

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:57.010
I want you to sign up for

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:00.420
the Super Chef Test in Guangzhou.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:02.180
Super Chef Test?

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.360
Super Chef Test!

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:12.680
Bring it on!

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.240
I’ll sure pass it!

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:19.210
Fight for the Dream

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:21.040
Super Chef Test

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.430
What do you think?

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.640
Good job, Mao!

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.290
You must do as well

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.840
in tomorrow’s Super Chef Test!

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.900
You can do it, Mao!

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:46.210
Oh, no, that’s liquor!

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:48.000
Thanks for your time.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.260
I’m going to show you

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:55.430
my signature Drunken Fist!

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.690
Come on!

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.340
Chef Ruoh,

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.270
are you alright?

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:05.420
I need to sleep.

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:09.250
Get up, Chef Ruoh!

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:13.460
Meili, are you drunk?

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:16.480
So what if I am?

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.360
Can’t I drink?

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.650
Mao, say it! Answer my question!

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:22.600
Let me go!

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:27.250
Ouch!

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.890
Is everything alright, father?

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:33.790
Why are you drinking alone?

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.920
Come and drink with us.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.630
You reek of alcohol.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:41.260
Do I?

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.880
So, father,

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:46.140
is the Super Chef Test difficult?

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:47.390
Of course it is!

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:48.960
If you think

00:03:49.010 --> 00:03:50.340
it’ll be that easy,

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:51.090
then you can’t be more wrong.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.140
The Test in Guangzhou

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:55.250
is said to be the toughest

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:56.800
in China.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:58.680
Super Chef

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.060
is not only an honorary title

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.030
but it also comes
with great responsibility.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.170
What was it like

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.100
when you took the Test, father?

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.770
We were asked to make congee.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:09.720
And that congee

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.930
must say youth.

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:14.370
Congee that says youth?

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.510
And what did you do, father?

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.390
I thought long and hard

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:20.860
and eventually, I used...

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:25.570
Hey, Mao,

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.050
a woman outside

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.520
asks to see you.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:30.350
What? A woman?

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.570
Really?

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:32.280
She asks for me?

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.160
You’re good!

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.900
Way to go, Mao!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.370
You've got fans

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.190
after that competition?

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.890
No way!

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:58.890
Did you ask to see me?

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:09.910
Is she the one?

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.020
She looks much older than Mao.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:14.080
I’m younger and prettier

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:16.060
than her.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:17.510
Sister!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.310
Mao... Mao’s sister?

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.270
I’m so glad

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:24.680
to see you doing so well.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:27.600
Keling! Am I in a dream?

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.270
Are... are you Keling?

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:31.960
I’m... I’m...

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:33.920
You must be Meili, right?

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.220
Mao said a lot about you in his letters

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.790
and how good you're to him.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.110
I’ll continue doing that.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:42.960
Thank you.

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:47.720
This is my sister.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.610
That’s Meili’s father,

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.660
Zhou Yu, also the head chef here.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:53.520
I’m Mao’s sister Keling.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:56.300
Thank you for taking care of my brother.

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:58.060
It’s nothing. Don’t mention it.

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.530
Nice to meet you.

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:02.500
Keling, is that...?

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.640
I've brought something for you.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.800
There are mother’s secret seasonings

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.210
and oil in the bags.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.200
I thought you might need them,

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.030
so there they are.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:12.860
Thank you so much!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.050
Meili, give me a hand.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:15.220
Sure!

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:16.360
Please,

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:17.830
make yourself at home.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:19.440
Thanks for your hospitality.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.310
Goodness! What’s in the bag?

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:29.860
It’s so heavy!

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.200
Seriously!

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.830
Why would anyone put this in it?

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:44.300
It’s killing me!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.730
Meili, come here!

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.620
Coming!

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.990
Easy-peasy.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:55.730
My mother gave me

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.300
her kitchenware.

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:00.990
This is her kitchen knife.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:02.530
From now on, whatever they throw at me,

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.730
I’ll chop everything

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:05.290
into pieces!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:06.630
I know you can, Mao!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.470
All of them seem skilled.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.440
This test

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.720
is likely to cast light

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:37.550
on your future.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.750
Aren’t you eager

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:40.920
to test your skills?

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.450
I’m going to follow in mother’s footsteps

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.260
and become a Super Chef!

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.080
This test

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.900
is one step closer to her achievement.

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:57.500
I’ll make you proud, mother!

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.220
Move it, shorty!

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.410
This place isn’t for kids to fool around.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:06.580
Mao!

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:08.960
Ouch!

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:10.280
Are you alright, Mao?

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.060
Where are your manners?

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:15.840
Looks like it’ll be one hell of a fight.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.930
Han, a skilled young chef
of Dongjiang Restaurant,

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.460
and his powerful

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.060
knife skills

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:22.860
cannot be underestimated.

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:25.370
Ryuuri Witch Che Lin

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.060
is the only female chef

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:27.990
in the Test.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:31.890
Head Chef of Bancai Restaurant, Tang,

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:33.020
is as good as

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.600
Chef Zhou Yu of Yang Spring Restaurant if not better.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.170
Is he that good?

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:39.590
Speaking of which,

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.760
I heard Chef Zhou Yu’s best apprentice

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:42.630
will be competing as well.

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:44.310
He’s young

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.860
but talented.

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.360
I wonder

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:50.900
what Chef Zhou Yu’s apprentice is like.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.430
It must be someone

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:54.570
bigger than Han

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.340
to be noticed

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.380
by Chef Zhou Yu.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.770
There’s someone else.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.720
That mysterious chef, Genius Fei.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.400
Genius Fei?

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:19.220
It’s getting started.

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.340
The judges are out.

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:26.550
Chefs,

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:27.480
your test will soon commence.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.060
As usual,

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:31.230
we’ll grade your dishes

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.460
in the order of completion.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.250
You have until sunset today.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:36.190
Also,

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.930
only five of you

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:39.820
will be able to pass the Test.

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:42.950
Once we've picked

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:45.960
all of them,

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:47.630
the test is over.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:50.810
Five? Only five?

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:51.780
That means

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:53.430
the faster you cook, the better.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.180
You got this, right, Mao?

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.720
Here’s what you’re going to cook.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.170
It is...

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:05.720
noodles.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.260
Noodles. So that’s it...

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:13.350
Here comes the twist.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.560
The theme is

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:23.600
Unparalleled Scholar

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.200
Unparalleled Scholar!

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:28.830
The theme is unparalleled scholar.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.920
Have your ingredients ready before noon

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.610
and put your answer on the plate

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.680
at the Cooking Arena.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:36.730
That’s all!

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:40.800
Cooking Arena!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:43.990
Cooking Arena

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:44.780
is designed for the Super Chef Test.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.110
Come on! Let's go!

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:49.540
Go to the market!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.140
Unparalleled Scholar Noodles!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:52.730
Hurry!

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.640
What’s your plan, Mao?

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.370
Everyone else is gone!

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.390
No need to rush.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.410
What are Unparalleled Scholar Noodles anyway?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.190
Never heard of such a thing.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:14.820
Xiao He once said,

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:16.560
“Generals are easy to come by,

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:20.680
but a talent like Han Xin
is Unparalleled Scholar ”.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:42.990
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:45.730
Excuse me...

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:49.000
Xiao He, the Prime Minister
of the Han Dynasty,

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:50.040
called

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:52.380
the then unappreciated General Han Xin

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:53.680
Unparalleled Scholar,

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:55.140
meaning

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:58.100
no one else in the country was his match.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:00.260
No one else was his match?

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:04.590
If you can come up with
Rising Dragon Dumpling,

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.130
you’ll sure pass this test.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:10.380
Wait!

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:14.770
Thank you. My name is Mao.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:15.980
And you’re...?

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.410
“Unparalleled Scholar”.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.830
“No one else in the country
was his match...”

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.420
But what does all that

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:38.170
have anything to do

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:40.190
with noodles?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:41.990
Mao,

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.490
stop racking your brain!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.770
It’s almost noon.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.060
We have all the ingredients

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:50.510
you need

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.260
to make any dish.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:53.010
You know

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:53.890
our restaurant has the best ingredients

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.100
in town!

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:57.120
Well...

00:12:58.180 --> 00:12:59.930
Enough! Moping won’t do any good!

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:03.300
Those who have got everything ready

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.710
can enter the Arena

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:05.830
and prepare for cooking.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.620
I’m Tang of Bancai Restaurant.

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:08.540
Alright. You may go in.

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:14.370
I wonder what noodles
they’re going to make.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:23.090
I’m Wang Hu of Shaolin Restaurant.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:24.720
I’ve got everything I need.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:26.000
Alright. You may go in.

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.900
I’m Yang of Yanglin Restaurant.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:31.960
Alright. You may go in.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.950
I’m Huo of Nanguo Restaurant.

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:36.010
Alright. You may go in.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.140
Wait!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.960
I’m Liu Maoxing of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:43.970
Alright. You may go in.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.110
The competition is intense.

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:12.290
Have they all figured out

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:14.110
what they’re going to make?

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:18.280
You have until the incense burns out.

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:19.640
Got it!

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.720
She’s what people call Ryuuri Witch.

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.630
Those snakes and frogs

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:35.190
look like part of her witchcraft.

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.330
Head Chef of Bancai Restaurant, Tang,

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.630
is using the local seafood.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:43.990
Does he think

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.680
seafood is the correct answer?

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:54.530
He was the one

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:55.590
who explained

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.470
the theme to me.

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:59.080
He’s a contestant, too.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:04.710
Is he wrapping up his dough

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:05.540
with something?

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:18.870
How come he’s ignoring us?

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:24.370
And he’s taking the wrapped dough out!

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:25.530
What a weirdo!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:33.580
That’s a primitive way to make stock!

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:38.960
Is he throwing a whole chicken in the pot?

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:40.530
Mao,

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.490
you aren’t here to watch a cooking show!

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:50.570
Mao!

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:00.200
How dare you peaking at my cooking!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:01.960
You've got guts, shorty!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:05.510
Don’t get any closer

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:06.870
if you still want to live!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:18.560
Mao, are you alright?

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.090
Did you get hurt?

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.470
The Super Chef Test
is only held every four years.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.050
It’s everyone’s goal

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.490
to pass it.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.110
No one here can afford to make a mistake.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:35.500
Look,

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.690
you’d better focus on your own cooking.

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:42.850
He's right.

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:47.260
Chefs in this room are the future

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.080
of the cooking industry in Guangzhou.

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.480
All of them know

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:52.250
it’s either go big or go home.

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:54.670
But I...

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:57.060
I must do something

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:58.680
or I’ll lose

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:00.080
before finding my own path.

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:03.820
What inspired you
to cook in the first place?

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:07.330
What inspired me to cook?

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:09.250
Whenever you’re lost,

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.170
think about your inspiration for cooking.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:12.970
My inspiration!

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:15.980
Who does he think he is?

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:17.830
Mao!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.700
My inspiration is...

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.250
Mother...

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:38.930
Yes, I got it!

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:40.320
That’s it.

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:41.900
It should be in here.

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:44.110
What are you looking for, Mao?

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:45.140
That’s the one.

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:46.390
All I need is that thing.

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:50.440
No way! How come it’s not here?

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:52.540
What exactly do you need, Mao?

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:53.600
Meili,

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.160
is that everything

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:56.300
from my sister?

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:58.500
I suppose.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:00.950
It can’t be.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.830
How could it not be here?

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:04.830
There was a kitchen knife,

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:07.160
a ladle, some seasonings...

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:10.130
Oh, right,

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:11.770
and a rock thingy, too.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:12.550
That’s the one!

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:13.280
Where is it?

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.790
Where did you put it, Meili?

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:17.730
It looked like a rock

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:18.770
and it was heavy,

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:20.010
so I left it in the yard.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:22.350
Mao!

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:28.290
Once entering the Arena,

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:29.690
no contestant shall leave

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:30.950
during the Test.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:32.030
But...

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:34.130
Step out, and you’ll be disqualified.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.600
Disqualified?

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:37.850
I’ll go get it.

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.010
It was my fault.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:40.920
Meili...

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:43.040
I’ll be back in time!

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.000
You’re my only hope, Meili!

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.820
Excuse me!

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:53.720
Coming through!

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:06.020
This is my incomparable soup

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.720
for my Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:38.850
Meili!

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:49.440
Are you alright, Meili?

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.350
What’s going on, Meili?

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:52.660
That rock!

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:54.580
Mao needs that rock!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:55.330
Rock!

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.190
It’s not here.

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:01.430
Where is it? Where did it go?

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.680
I remember throwing it
somewhere around here!

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:04.270
Rock?

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:06.320
Could it be that thing?

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:07.490
Have you seen it?

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:20.000
Hey, shorty,

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:21.700
what’s your game?

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:22.640
You’ve been sitting there idly

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:23.740
since the beginning

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:25.780
in this sanctuary

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:27.470
for those who're cooking with their lives.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.240
Go home if you aren’t here to cook!

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:30.280
It’s annoying!

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:38.810
Found it!

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.780
It’s too heavy for you, Meili.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:46.020
I’ll take it to him.

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:47.240
I’ll do it.

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:48.460
I made the mistake.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:50.950
Besides,

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:54.940
this is the only thing

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.290
I can do for him now.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:01.580
Go, Meili!

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:02.520
Yes!

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:08.840
Please, I can’t be late!

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:30.540
If Meili comes back quickly,

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:32.930
there might still be enough time.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.430
She’ll make it! I trust her!

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:17.813
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.813 --> 00:23:20.816
I'm waiting for Meili,
believing that she will definitely come.

00:23:20.816 --> 00:23:22.775
At last, the first person to pass the test,

00:23:22.859 --> 00:23:26.195
wow, what a splendid Unparalled Scholar Noodle!

00:23:26.279 --> 00:23:28.740
Oh, another hand was raised!

00:23:28.740 --> 00:23:30.533
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.616 --> 00:23:33.202
The Ultimate Skill! Unparalled Scholar Noodle

00:23:33.287 --> 00:23:34.663
It will definitely be interesting!
